WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
It's just a pet fox that follows its owner.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,000
Just like you kid, you don’t know how high the sky is and how high it is.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Are you good at talking words?

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
OK OK

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Even when death is imminent, you are still so arrogant

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Then I'll show you what I'm really capable of

7
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Flame Wolf

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Go roast this fox

9
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,620
Didn't expect such a coincidence

10
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:25,620
I happened to draw the two younger brothers of Elder Danyangzi and Elder Wang.

11
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:27,620
What a coincidence indeed

12
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:30,620
My disciple is already a fourth-level spiritual master

13
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:33,620
Much stronger than other handyman disciples

14
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:37,620
Originally, it was a bit unfair for him to participate in the drawing of lots.

15
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:40,360
Listen to what Elder Wang wants

16
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:42,360
I feel that my apprentice is stable
